  <para style="h">Petro 2</para>
  <para style="toc1">Petro 2</para>
  <para style="toc2">Petro 2</para>
  <para style="toc3">Pet2</para>
  <para style="mt1">Petro 2</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2PE 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 1:1" />Womi nɛ Simon Petro nɛ ji Yesu Kristo tsɔlɔ kɛ fiɛlɔ ɔ ngma kɛ ya ha nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ a ha lɛ hemi kɛ yemi nɛ he jua wa kaa wa nɔ ɔ, kɛ gu wa Mawu kɛ wa Kpɔlɔ Yesu Kristo dami nɔ ji enɛ ɔ nɛ:<verse eid="2PE 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nutsɔ ɔ lemi saminya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 1:2" />Dloomi kɛ he jɔmi babauu nɛ je Mawu kɛ wa Nutsɔ Yesu lemi mi ɔ nɛ ba nyɛ nɔ. <verse eid="2PE 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 1:3" />Ejakaa ke nyɛ le lɛ saminya a, e ma ha nyɛ nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ nɛ he maa hia nyɛ ngɛ e he wami nɛ kle ɔ nya, nɛ nyɛ ma na si himi kpakpa. Ejakaa e tsɛ wɔ nɛ waa kɛ lɛ nɛ hi e anunyami kɛ e himi ɔ mi. <verse eid="2PE 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 1:4" />Nɛ ngɛ e he wami ɔ kɛ nya a, e ha wɔ nyakpɛ jɔɔmi nike ni kpakpa kpahi kulaa nɛ e wo wɔ si ngɛ he ɔ, konɛ kɛ gu a nɔ ɔ, wa nyɛ nɛ waa yu wa he kɛ je he lo se dimi kɛ hɛ mi kpatami níhi nɛ ngɛ je ɔ mi ɔ a he, nɛ waa ngɔ e subai.<verse eid="2PE 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 1:5" />Se loko ji nyɛ nine maa su kikɛmɛ a nike ni nɛ ɔmɛ a nɔ ɔ, tsa pi hemi kɛ yemi kɛkɛ nɛ he hia nyɛ, e he hia kaa nyɛɛ pee nyɛ he nimli kpakpahi, nɛ lɔ ɔ hu pí. E he hia kaa nyɛɛ bɔ mɔde nɛ nyɛ hla nɛ nyɛɛ le nɔ́ nɛ e ngɛ nyɛ hlae nɛ nyɛ tsu. <verse eid="2PE 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 1:6" />Lɔ ɔ se ɔ, nyɛɛ bɔ mɔde nɛ nyɛɛ le nyɛ he nɔ hyɛmi. Nyɛ na tsui si tomi, nɛ nyɛɛ pee nyɛ he Mawu nimli, nɛ nyɛ ha Mawu nɛ e kudɔ nyɛ. <verse eid="2PE 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 1:7" />Nɛ enɛ ɔ ma ha nyɛ na adesa he suɔmi kpakpa. <verse eid="2PE 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 1:8" />Enɛ ɔmɛ ji níhi nɛ a he hia nyɛ. Ke nyɛ nine su a nɔ ɔ, nyɛ maa wa ngɛ mumi mi nɛ nyɛ maa wo yiblii, nɛ nyɛ he maa ba se nami kɛ ha wa Nutsɔ Yesu Kristo. <verse eid="2PE 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 1:9" />Nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ na we ni nɛ ɔmɛ kɛ piɛ we e hemi kɛ yemi he ɔ, e hɛ ngmɛ ywia saminya, aloo e nɛ ni kɛ yɛ lokoo, nɛ e hɛ je nɔ kaa Mawu je lɛ kɛ je e sa si himi yaya a mi, nɛ e sa kaa jehanɛ ɔ e hi si himi kpakpa kɛ ha Nutsɔ ɔ.<verse eid="2PE 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 1:10" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, anyɛmimɛ, nyɛ tsu ni wawɛɛ nɛ nyɛ kɛ tsɔɔ kaa nyɛ piɛ nihi nɛ Mawu tsɛ nɛ e hla amɛ a he niinɛ, nɛ jehanɛ ɔ, nyɛ be si tɛe aloo nyɛ be si gbee. <verse eid="2PE 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 1:11" />Nɛ Mawu ma bli Hiɔwe agbo ɔmɛ gbajaa kɛ ha nyɛ nɛ nyɛɛ sɛ wa Nutsɔ kɛ Yiwamihelɔ Yesu Kristo neneene matsɛ yemi ɔ mi.<verse eid="2PE 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 1:12" />Nyɛ le kikɛmɛ a ni nɛ ɔmɛ momo, nɛ nyɛ ngɛ nɔ yae saminya bɔ nɛ sa, se i to nɛ ma hi nyɛ kaie ngɛ a he. <verse eid="2PE 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 1:13" />I susu kaa e sa nɛ ma hi nyɛ si hɛlie ngɛ munyu nɛ ɔmɛ a he be abɔ nɛ i ngɛ wami mi ɔ. <verse eid="2PE 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 1:14" />I le kaa e be kɛe nɛ i ma ngmɛɛ nɔmlɔ tso nɛ gboɔ nɛ ɔ he kaa bɔ nɛ wa Nutsɔ Yesu Kristo je kɛ tsɔɔ mi paa a. <verse eid="2PE 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 1:15" />I heɔ yeɔ kaa i ma gbla ni nɛ ɔmɛ a mi saminya kɛ ha nyɛ bɔ nɛ nyɛ ma kai mɛ be fɛɛ be ke i si je mi.<verse eid="2PE 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 1:16" />Munyuhi nɛ wa tu nyɛ ngɛ Nutsɔ Yesu Kristo he wami kɛ e bami ekohu ɔ he ɔ, a pi nyazia. Ami nitsɛ i na e agbo jemi kɛ anunyami ɔ kɛ ye hɛ ngmɛ. <verse eid="2PE 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 1:17" />Wa ngɛ lejɛ ɔ benɛ Tsɛ Mawu wo e hɛ mi nyami, nɛ anunyami gbi ko pɛ kɛ agbo jemi ke, “Ami nitsɛ ye suɔmi Bi ji nɛ ɔ nɛ, nɛ i naa e he bua jɔmi!” <verse eid="2PE 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 1:18" />Wɔ nitsɛmɛ wa nu gbi nɛ ɔ nɛ je hiɔwe benɛ waa kɛ lɛ ngɛ yoku klɔuklɔu ɔ nɔ ɔ.<verse eid="2PE 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 1:19" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, wa na kaa munyu nɛ gbali ɔmɛ tu ɔ ba mi. Nɛ e maa hi kɛ ha nyɛ ke nyɛ maa hyɛ nɔ́ fɛɛ nɔ nɛ e ngma a mi fitsofitso ejakaa, kaa bɔ nɛ kane kpɛɔ kɛ yaa diblii mi kɔ nyahi ɔ, a munyu ɔmɛ yeɔ kɛ buaa wɔ nɛ waa nu níhi fuu nɛ jinɛ a he wa nɛ a wo wɔ diblii ɔ a sisi. Nɛ ke nyɛ susu gbali ɔmɛ a nyakpɛ anɔkuale munyu ɔmɛ a he ɔ, la a maa sɛ nyɛ mi nɛ Kristo nɛ ji Mɔtu Dodomi ɔ ma kpɛ ngɛ nyɛ tsui mi. <verse eid="2PE 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 1:20" />Nɛ ngɛ nɔ́ fɛɛ nɔ se ɔ, nyɛ kai kaa nɔ ko be nɛ lɛ nitsɛ e ma nyɛ tsɔɔ gbami munyu ngɛ Ngmami ɔ mi sisi ngɛ lɛ nitsɛ e suɔmi nya, <verse eid="2PE 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 1:21" />se Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ nɛ haa nɛ a tuɔ munyu nɛ je Mawu ngɔ ɔ nɛ.<verse eid="2PE 1:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2PE 2" />
  <para style="s1">Lakpa gbali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 2:1" />Se jamɛ a be ɔ mi ɔ, lakpa gbali hu ngɛ ni ɔmɛ a kpɛti kaa bɔ nɛ nyangɔ tsɔɔli maa hi nyɛ kpɛti ɔ. A maa ngɔ nɔ́ puɛmi kɛ lakpa tsɔɔmihi kɛ ba ngɛ laami mi, nɛ a ma kua Nutsɔ nɛ kpɔ mɛ ɔ tete, nɛ lɔ ɔ a ma kɛ gbla hɛ mi kpatami kɛ ba mɛ nitsɛmɛ a nɔ tlukaa. <verse eid="2PE 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 2:2" />Nɛ nihi fuu maa nyɛɛ a basabasa nyɛɛmi ɔmɛ a se. Nɛ a ni peemi ni ɔmɛ a he je ɔ, nihi maa ye Kristo munyu ɔ he fɛu.<verse eid="2PE 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 2:3" />Tsɔɔli hɛ tsuli nɛ ɔmɛ ma de nyɛ nɔ́ ko kɛkɛ bɔ nɛ pee nɛ a nine nɛ su nyɛ sika nɔ. Se Mawu bu mɛ fɔ momo, nɛ a hɛ mi kpatami ngɛ blɔ nɔ kɛ ma. <verse eid="2PE 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 2:4" />Ejakaa bɔfo ɔmɛ tete nɛ pee yayami ɔ, Mawu kɛ pɛ mɛ, e muɔ mɛ kɛ wo hɛ mi kpatami mi, nɛ a wo mɛ kɔsɔkɔsɔ ngɛ muɔ nɛ mi wo diblii mi; nɛ a maa hi lejɛ ɔ kɛ ya si kojomi ligbi ɔ. <verse eid="2PE 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 2:5" />Mawu ngɔɛ blema bi ɔmɛ nɛ hi si loko ji nyu jemi ɔ ba a, a he kɛ pɛ mɛ, ja Noa nɔ nɛ fiɛ Mawu he sane kpakpa a, e kɛ e we bi kpaago ɔmɛ pɛ. Jamɛ a be ɔ mi ɔ, Mawu kpata nihi kulaa nɛ yi lɛ gbeye ɔ a hɛ mi kɛ nyu jemi ɔ ngɛ je ɔ mi tsuo. <verse eid="2PE 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 2:6" />Pee se ɔ, e kpata Sodom kɛ Gomora ma amɛ a hɛ mi butuu kɛ la, nɛ e ngɔ mɛ kɛ pee nɔ hyɛmi nɔ́ kɛ ha hwɔɔ se bimɛ nɛ be lɛ gbeye yee ɔ konɛ a na nɔ́ nɛ maa ba a nɔ.<verse eid="2PE 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 2:7" />E he Lot yi wami nɛ e je lɛ kɛ je Sodom, ejakaa e ji nɔmlɔ kpakpa, nɛ nihi nɛ li mlaa a, a yakayaka je mi bami haoɔ lɛ. <verse eid="2PE 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 2:8" />Jamɛ a nɔmlɔ kpakpa a hi si ngɛ a kpɛti, nɛ je fɛɛ je nɛ maa na a, e haoɔ, ejakaa e nuɔ, nɛ e naa a ni peemi ni yaya amɛ. <verse eid="2PE 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 2:9" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, Nutsɔ ɔ le bɔ nɛ e ma kpɔ nihi nɛ yeɔ lɛ gbeye ɔ kɛ je a pimi ɔmɛ a mi, kɛ bɔ nɛ e maa hi yi mi walɔ ɔ tue gblae kɛ ya si kojomi ligbi ɔ. <verse eid="2PE 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 2:10" />Titli ɔ, nihi nɛ ngɔɔ a nɔmlɔ tso ɔ kɛ peeɔ yakayaka mu níhi nɛ a bui Mawu. Kikɛmɛ a tsɔɔli sisili nɛ ɔmɛ fĩaa kɛ tuɔ munyu. A be bumi ko kɛ ha anunyami bimɛ nɛ ngɛ hiɔwe, se jɛmi mohu nɛ a jɛɔ mɛ. <verse eid="2PE 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 2:11" />Bɔfo ɔmɛ tete ngɛ hiɔwe, nɛ a kle, nɛ a ngɛ he wami hluu pe tsɔɔli sisili nɛ ɔmɛ ɔ, a tui nɔ buimi munyu kɛ si we mɛ ngɛ Nutsɔ ɔ hɛ mi.<verse eid="2PE 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 2:12" />Se kikɛmɛ a nimli nɛ ɔmɛ be juɛmi, a peeɔ nɔ́ fɛɛ nɔ nɛ a susuu we he. A ngɛ kaa lohwe awi yeli nɛ a hɛ mi jɔɛ, nɛ a maa nu mɛ nɛ a gbe mɛ. Níhi nɛ a juɛmi sui he, nɛ a nui sisi ɔ peeɔ mɛ muɔ. A ma kpata a hɛ mi kaa lohwe awi yeli nɛ a hɛ mi jɔɛ.<verse eid="2PE 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 2:13" />Hiɔwo nɛ tsɔɔli nɛ ɔmɛ ma na ngɛ a yayami ɔmɛ a he ɔ ji enɛ ɔ nɛ. Ejakaa a naa bua jɔmi ngɛ yayami níhi a mi daa ligbi. A ji hɛ mi si puemi kɛ ha nyɛ, kɛ nimli nɛ maa wo nyɛ he mu. Be mi nɛ a ngɛ yayami pee ɔ, a sisiɔ nyɛ nɛ a kɛ nyɛ ba yeɔ ni kaa anɔkualetsɛmɛ. <verse eid="2PE 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 2:14" />Yakayaka yihi pɛ ji nihi nɛ a suɔ. Yayami peemi tɔɛ mɛ, nɛ a sisiɔ nihi nɛ a gbɔjɔ ɔmɛ. A kase he tsumi. A ji nihi nɛ Mawu gbiɛ mɛ! <verse eid="2PE 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 2:15" />A je blɔ dadɛ ɔ nɔ nɛ a laa blɔ. A gu blɔ nɛ Bosor bi Balaam gu ɔ, nɔ nɛ suɔ sika nɛ e ma na ngɛ yayami peemi mi ɔ. <verse eid="2PE 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 2:16" />Se a tsi Balaam nya ngɛ e kuasia blɔ nɛ e hia a he, benɛ e okpɔngɔ ɔ tu munyu kɛ nɔmlɔ gbi nɛ e kã e hɛ mi ɔ.<verse eid="2PE 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 2:17" />Nimli nɛ ɔmɛ a he be se nami, a ngɛ kaa pa nɛ nyu ta mi. Nɛ a ngɛ kaa bɔ kuu nɛ kɔɔhiɔ ngɛ lɛ fiae kɛ bee nɛ e be sida he. He nɛ a to kɛ ha mɛ ji muɔ voo nɛ mi wo diblii ɔ. <verse eid="2PE 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 2:18" />A fiaa kɛ he nɔ womi ngɛ a yayami kɛ kunimi yemi ɔ he, nɛ a guu he lo akɔnɔ níhi a nɔ kɛ mlɔɔ nihi nɛ a je si himi yaya a mi kɛ we ɔ kɛ ya woɔ yayami mi ekohu.<verse eid="2PE 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 2:19" />A deɔ ke, “Tsa pi kpakpa peemi he je nɛ a ma he o yi wami ngɛ, lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, o ma nyɛ pee yayami. Moo pee nɔ́ nɛ o suɔ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2PE 2:19">Kikɛmɛ a tsɔɔli nɛ ɔmɛ de mɛ ke a maa ye a he kɛ je mlaa a dɛ mi, be mi nɛ mɛ nitsɛmɛ ɔ, yayami nyɔguɛhi ji mɛ. Ejakaa nɔ́ fɛɛ nɔ nɛ yeɔ nɔ ko nɔ ɔ, e yeɔ lɛ nyɔguɛ. <verse eid="2PE 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 2:20" />Nɛ ke ji nɔ ko le wa Nutsɔ kɛ Yiwamihelɔ Yesu Kristo, nɛ lɔ ɔ ha e je e he kɛ je je nɛ ɔ mi yi mi wami ni peemi ɔmɛ a mi, se e kpale ya sɛ yayami mi nɛ e pee e nyɔguɛ ekohu ɔ, e puɛɔ pe kekle ɔ po. <verse eid="2PE 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 2:21" />E maa hi ke ji e li Kristo kulaa, pe nɛ nɛ e le lɛ nɛ jehanɛ ɔ se ɔ, e plɛ e se kɛ wo kita klɔuklɔu ɔmɛ nɛ a kɛ ha lɛ ɔ. <verse eid="2PE 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2PE 2:22" />E baa mi kɛ haa mɛ ja, kaa bɔ nɛ abɛ nɛ ɔ de ɔ ke, “Gbe kpaleɔ kɛ baa e vie he, nɛ ke a du kpotoo he ha lɛ ɔ, e kpaleɔ kɛ ya wuɔ mɔsɔ ekohu.”<verse eid="2PE 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2PE 3" />
  <para style="s1">Kristo maa ba ekohu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 3:1" />Anyɛmimɛ nɛ a suɔ, enɛ ɔ ji womi enyɔne nɛ i ngɛ nyɛ ngmae. I ngma womi nɛ ɔmɛ nɛ ma kɛ kai nyɛ ngɛ níhi nɛ nyɛ le momo ɔ a he, <verse eid="2PE 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 3:2" />nɛ ji níhi nɛ nyɛ kase kɛ je gbali klɔuklɔu ɔmɛ a ngɔ, kɛ wɔ bɔfo ɔmɛ nɛ wa ngɔ wa Nutsɔ kɛ Yiwamihelɔ ɔ munyu ɔ kɛ ba ha nyɛ ɔ wa nya.<verse eid="2PE 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 3:3" />Kekleekle ɔ, i suɔ nɛ ma kai nyɛ kaa ngɛ nyagbe ligbi ɔmɛ a mi ɔ, he fɛu yeli maa ba nɛ a maa pee yayami tsuaa yayami nɛ a ma nyɛ, nɛ a maa ye anɔkuale ɔ he fɛu. <verse eid="2PE 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 3:4" />Nɔ́ nɛ a ma de ji, “Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, Yesu wo si kaa e maa kpale kɛ ba, e ngɛ mi ja a lo? Ke ja a, jije e ngɛ? E be bae gblee! Mɛni he je? Ejakaa ke nyɛ ma kai ɔ, kɛ je benɛ wa tsɛmɛ gbo ɔ, nɔ́ fɛɛ nɔ ngɛ nɔ yae pɛpɛɛpɛ kaa bɔ nɛ a ngɛ kɛ je je ɔ sisije ɔ.” <verse eid="2PE 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 3:5" />A je blɔ nɛ a si anɔkuale nɛ ɔ se kaa hiɔwe ngɛ kɛ je sisije, nɛ Mawu tu munyu nɛ zugba a ba bɔ ade kɛ je nyu mi, nɛ e ngɛ nyuhi a kpɛti. <verse eid="2PE 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 3:6" />Nɛ nyu nɔuu a kɛ puɛ je nɛ hi si momo ɔ. <verse eid="2PE 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 3:7" />Nɛ ngɛ jamɛ a munyu ɔ nɔuu nya a, a ngɔ hiɔwe kɛ zugba nɛ ngɛ piɔ ɔ kɛ to nɛ la ma kpata a hɛ mi ngɛ kojomi ligbi ɔ nɔ, be mi nɛ a ma kpata yayami peeli a hɛ mi ɔ.<verse eid="2PE 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 3:8" />Se anyɛmimɛ suɔli, nyɛ hɛ nɛ ko je nɔ kaa ligbi kake ngɛ kaa jeha akpe, nɛ jeha akpe ngɛ kaa ligbi kake ngɛ Nutsɔ ɔ hɛ mi. <verse eid="2PE 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 3:9" />Anɔkuale mi ɔ, pi se nɛ e ngɛ kpɛe ngɛ e bami ɔ mi, wɔ nɛ wa naa lɛ ja be komɛ. Se e ngɛ mlɛe, ejakaa e sume kaa nɔ ko hɛ mi nɛ kpata, lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, e ngɛ yayami peeli be hae nɛ a tsake. <verse eid="2PE 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 3:10" />Nutsɔ ɔ bami ligbi ɔ ma, nɛ nguane jemi be he. E maa ba tlukaa kaa julɔ, nɛ hiɔwe ma butu kɛ ngmlaa nɛ nya wa. A maa sa hiɔwe ní ɔmɛ kɛ la, nɛ zugba a kɛ nɔ́ fɛɛ nɔ nɛ ngɛ nɔ ɔ ma ngla.<verse eid="2PE 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 3:11" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, nɛ níhi nɛ bɔle wɔ ɔ tsuo hɛ mi ma kpata a, lɛɛ e sa nɛ waa hi si himi nɛ he tsɔ nɛ waa pee wa he Mawu jali, <verse eid="2PE 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 3:12" />be mi nɛ wa ngɛ mlɛe nɛ wa ngɛ Mawu bami be ɔ blɔ hyɛe, ejakaa jamɛ a be ɔ mi nɛ Mawu maa ma hiɔwe ɔ he la, nɛ hiɔwe níhi kulaa a hɛ mi ma kpata ngɛ la mi. <verse eid="2PE 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 3:13" />Se wa ngɛ Mawu si womi ɔ blɔ hyɛe, kaa ngɛ ni nɛ ɔmɛ a se ɔ, hiɔwe he kɛ zugba he maa ba, nɛ dami sane yemi maa hi si.<verse eid="2PE 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 3:14" />Anyɛmimɛ suɔli, be mi nɛ wa ngɛ ní nɛ ɔmɛ kɛ a bami ɔ blɔ hyɛe ɔ, nyɛɛ bɔ mɔde nɛ nyɛɛ hi si nɛ nyɛ ko pee yayami; nɛ nyɛɛ kɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ kpɛti nɛ hi saminya, bɔ nɛ pee nɛ ke e ba a, e na nyɛ he bua jɔmi.<verse eid="2PE 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 3:15" />Nyɛɛ ngɔ wa Nutsɔ ɔ tsui si tomi ɔ kaa he blɔ nɛ e ha nyɛ nɛ a kɛ he nyɛ yi wami. Wa nyɛminyumu Paulo, nɔ nɛ wa suɔ lɛ saminya a, de nyɛ enɛ ɔ be mi nɛ e ngma nyɛ womi kɛ juɛmi pɔtɛɛ ko nɛ a kɛ ke lɛ ɔ. <verse eid="2PE 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 3:16" />Be fɛɛ be ɔ, e ngmaa níhi kaa kikɛ ɔ ngɛ e womi ɔmɛ a mi. Munyu komɛ ngɛ e womi ɔmɛ a mi nɛ a sisi numi wa, nɛ e haa nɛ nihi nɛ a juɛmi nya wɛ ɔ, a tsakeɔ e munyu ɔmɛ a hɛ mi kaa bɔ nɛ a tsakeɔ Mawu Munyu ɔ ekomɛ ɔ, nɛ e ji hɛ mi kpatami kɛ ha mɛ nitsɛmɛ.<verse eid="2PE 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 3:17" />Anyɛmimɛ, i ngɛ nyɛ si woe loko be ɔ nɛ ba su, bɔ nɛ pee nɛ nyɛ hɛ nɛ hi nyɛ he nɔ, nɛ yi mi wali nɛ ɔmɛ a tɔmi ɔmɛ nɛ ko kpata nyɛ nane. <verse eid="2PE 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 3:18" />Se mohu nyɛɛ wa ngɛ mumi ɔ he wami ɔ mi, nɛ nyɛɛ le wa Nutsɔ kɛ Yiwamihelɔ Yesu Kristo ɔ saminya. Lɛ a ngɔ anunyami kɛ ha kɛ je be nɛ ɔ mi kɛ ya neneene! Amen.<verse eid="2PE 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 3" />
</usx>